{"about_the_game":"In this first-person science fiction thriller, you must uncover the secrets of the IAS Antarctic Research Complex and attempt to survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Focus on exploring </h2>Find passwords for doors, search for access cards for terminals, repair damaged equipment and combine items. Think with your head.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Intense battles</h2>You have a gun, but that doesn't mean you're safe. The enemies here are deadly, and not all of them can be killed...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The atmosphere of cold loneliness</h2>The graphics, inspired by early 3D games, combined with atmospheric sound effects, make the game world seem even more gloomy and unwelcoming.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nonlinear narrative</h2>Balance between clarity and madness, making conscious or unconscious decisions, and finding out what they will lead to!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2931820?t=1729891690","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2931820?t=1729891690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729891690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931820/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1729891690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"ZERO PROTOCOL contains scenes of violence and gore toward humanoid enemies. There are also images of corpses and blood in the game."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"In this first-person science fiction thriller, you must uncover the secrets of the IAS Antarctic Research Complex and attempt to survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Focus on exploring </h2>Find passwords for doors, search for access cards for terminals, repair damaged equipment and combine items. Think with your head.